@startuml state_diagram_gui

skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam stateFontStyle bold

top to bottom direction

[*] --> GUIStartup

GUIStartup --> InputState : window initialized

InputState --> OperationSelected : operation button clicked
InputState --> [*] : window closed

OperationSelected --> InputState : status updated with selection
InputState --> ValidatingInput : Calculate button clicked

ValidatingInput --> Calculating : input valid
ValidatingInput --> ErrorDisplay : invalid operand
ErrorDisplay --> InputState : error shown

Calculating --> ResultDisplay : success
Calculating --> ErrorDisplay : error

ResultDisplay --> HistoryUpdate : result calculated
HistoryUpdate --> InputState : auto-clear ready

InputState --> InputState : Clear button clicked

@enduml
